  m_text: "These sliders control fans, used for cooling the reactor. Each one controls
    a different fan \u2013 sliding them forward increases their speed, while sliding
    them down decreases them. \r\nResults of increasing the sliders:\r\n- Electricity
    produced\r\n- Temperature\r\n"
